A '''chair store''' was located on the [[planet]] [[Ferrix]]. An [[Aurebesh]] sign by the entrance was used to attract potential customers and read "CHAIRS," with an illustration of a chair.<ref name="Andor 1" /> Various chairs were also exhibited by the entrance. The business was located on [[Rix Road]], across the street from [[Hotel Rix|a hotel]]; near [[Ferrix Depot]], [[Gavalox Communications]], and the [[Ferrix bell tower]].<ref name="Rix">{{Andor|Rix Road (episode)}}</ref>

